**Heap** (phone, 180s flight): PASS — not a steady climb (27.5 MB → 31.7 MB → 29.3 MB)

Frame ms is the work inside the animation callbacks for that frame (summed when the page schedules more than one). The median is the median of the slower half of those frames, so a cheap frame between paints does not hide the loaded one. It is not the vsync gap, and it is not a Galaxy or A10 frame rate.
Fail rules: that median worse than 5%, the 1% low (mean of the slowest 1% of frames) worse than 10%, any flicker frame, or a heap that climbs through all three thirds of the flight and does not come back.

